Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you want it,\NThen you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise,\NAnd freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day,\NCause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece, I'll be\Nthe first. I'll put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Be so bad, I could first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing. Feel it waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was quite taken aback by the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But perhaps that is my ignorance speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.92,0:02:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you believe it's a wise decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom is ruthless, but\Nshe lets us do as we please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then if I may be frank once more,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it surprises me that\Nyou're comfortable taking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,orders from anyone other\Nthan fish or tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.74,0:03:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not above working under someone\Nelse's authority by any means.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the way it works in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If a captain wishes to guarantee\Nthe safety of his crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,allying with the four emperors\Nis the best way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that you're doing it\Nfor the good of Fishman Island as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after Whitebeard's passing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Our kingdom remains safe\Nunder Big Mom's protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,because you connected us with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't thank you enough for that, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, please don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a responsibility to make\Nsure Fishman Island is protected,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,even if we are wanted criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Having said that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that the time may have come for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,me to terminate my\Npartnership with Big Maw.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you're going to\Naccept Luffy's invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Team Bae, what do you say, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you join my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But the pirate world operates through...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,honor, not contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd much rather make a verbal agreement\Nover drinks than sign documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we mustn't go breaking such agreements\Nwithout careful consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What concerns me the most\Nis the possibility that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom will direct your\Nanger at Fishman Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Gene Bay, you need not feel\Nresponsible for every little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If such an incident comes\Nto pass, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan why just\Ntoday we took in 70 000
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,fierce newcomers from\NFishman District they'll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,make fine soldiers do\Nnot worry about his job
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the event we lose the protection\Nof Big Mom's Jolly Roger, there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,is another flag I'd like to use\Ninstead. One with a Straw Hat might
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,look nice don't you think Jungle\Ncouldn't agree more I'm partial to that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,flag myself your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,majesty forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have a serious problem. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Minister of the Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember something from long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we made a mistake by letting the Straw\NHat Pirates keep that stolen treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not certain if they\Nfound it yet, but if they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,could you please ask them to\Ngive the Tamate Box back to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.66,0:05:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never ask them to return a\Ngift that we gave them for saving us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If they open it, it'll explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,after the Tomate Box was\Nstolen ten years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured if another thief were to take\Nit, we ought to teach them a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to rig the\Nbox with explosives that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,would detonate as soon\Nas the box was opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed like a good idea at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and since I'm in charge of the Tomate Box\Nand the rest of the treasure chamber, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If Luffy and the others\Nreturn with the treasures,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,please explain the situation and take the\Ntomate box back before someone gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I do apologize. Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's still a chance that\Nthey'll open it before they get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that concerns me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.18,0:06:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Minister, an update.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others have just returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so they made it back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears I was worried over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave the treasure to Big Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She was gonna wreck the whole island\Nbecause she didn't get any candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is her problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if it was me, I'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I already handled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I picked up that snail\Nand gave her a piece of my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but no one talks back to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.72,0:07:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are brave Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't encourage him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a good thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.38,0:07:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't yell at me, News!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you it's Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy, what have you done now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better sever my bond with Big Mom\Nbefore this gets any more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand this may be difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,especially for your hard-hitting captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but please refrain from\Nagitating her anymore! No joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:07:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She's one of the Four Emperors\Nand I'm way too young to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is even worse than we feared!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.04,0:08:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If Big Bomb gets that tomate\Nbox and she opens it herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it's going to blow up in her\Nface and then we're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll think Straw Hat's trying to start
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,trouble and then there'll\Nbe a war on her hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We mustn't let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like you had\Nany other choice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's already been done now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you kind of had to stand up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I can't really\Nbe upset at you over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, I couldn't just let\Nher punish these guys for...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Still!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you gave her\Nall of the treasure! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll punch you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You did that already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.32,0:08:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.28,0:08:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To the new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already dead, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, not far from the\Ncandy factory... Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.94,0:09:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone must have picked up the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and ran when I was\Nknocked out on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever the thief may be, I'll make\Nsure they suffer for what they've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do now is confront those\Npickpockets and take the riches back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,With that and the new information\Nabout the mermaid princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make a good impression for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they and what have\Nthey got in those bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it! Those are mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait till I catch you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bury you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I stole those treasures once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I can steal them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.07,0:09:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've seen\Nthat ugly mug before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is Says here he's an up-and-comer\NGoes by the name Wethead Caribou
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so he's worth 200 million Great,\Njust when we thought this was over
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's too late for\Nyou to beg for mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Swamp, Swamp Cat Lincoln
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happens\Nwhen you steal from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Scraping!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.95,0:10:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What else would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A turtle's own type, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:10:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,People with low-geared double fruit\Npowers always end up dying young.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools think that power\Nmakes you invincible and bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Half-bord challenges\Nare très disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Alliance, Monsieur Peccombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's worth 200\Nmillion, and he just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If I remember, Peccombs has\Na bounty of 330 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.78,0:11:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And Big Mom probably makes what he\Njust did look like child's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope Luffy knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And somewhere near the red line\Nin the waters of the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another one at two o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire ships are popping up\Nall over the place, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to get on a good side,\Nyou suck up. Mind your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Business. They finally set me\Nfree from that living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shield you from arm, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.42,0:13:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our Captain for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That was really beautiful, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the sword play\Nwasn't half bad either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you taking this seriously or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of you should know\Nhow to deflect a bombshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There was never a better time to\Nuse that skill than just now, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.62,0:13:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, that's a mast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I cleaned your glasses for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.96,0:13:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's like a flower\Namong this filthy crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fool around in the middle of combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get yourselves killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.42,0:13:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The G5 is such a joke and to\Nthink you're all Navy soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:14:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you had better not take me lightly\Njust because I'm a woman. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Toshiki, you're\Njust so adorable. How can I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,not respect you that's exactly\Nthe kind of treatment I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,mean there's a difference\Nbetween respect and whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you keep it down to shiki
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm busy my apologies sir i
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,see so a pirate from the\Nseafloor named Heart jones
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,took you captive that explains\Na lot that must be why
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,there were no rookies passing\Nthrough fishman island
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,recently took us captive i wish\Nhe made us his slaves Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,stirred up some kind of\Ncivil war on fish man island
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he made us fight for his\Nside and then this group of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,pirates set us free a group\Nof pirates yeah but i'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,telling you who don't be\Nstupid can't you see who we're
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,dealing with they're not just\Nnavy soldiers they're the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,g5 they use pirates as bait\Nwhen they fish for sharks
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:15:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,or even as kindling for a\Nbonfire they're the rogue
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,unit of the navy they don't\Neven obey orders from HQ!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you have no idea how\Nruthless these bastards are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the people to be caught by,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,we had to end up in the hands of\Nthe notorious White Chase Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Vice Admiral, can\Nwe take over from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones who defeated\NHeart Jones and his crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the Straw Hat Pirates, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that already, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.98,0:15:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Charlie, Luffy and his\Nfriends are setting sail now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should see\Nthem off. Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:15:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanna go say goodbye too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I need somebody to\Nstay here and run the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have more tourists here now that\Nwe're rid of that despicable Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So I need you girls to keep this\Nplace in tip-top shape for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Madam Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the crystal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm through with that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to look\Ninto the future. Anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, fishman island being\Ntorn apart by Straw Hat luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a future\NI never wanted to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So if my prediction turned\Nout to be incorrect this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,then nothing would make me happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows her visions are never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be more scared than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And it may not come true anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be tomorrow or a year from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So we don't know when\Nwe can stop worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.84,0:17:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, madam. Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But luffy chin and the\Nothers would never Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that you forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have suspected your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.66,0:17:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'd like me to trust\Nthe Straw Hat boy then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, for your trip.\NSweet! Thanks, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy, do you really have to\Nset sail from here immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I only just met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with us at least one more day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, better yet, another week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a year, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:18:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Weepy Hachi, you haven't stopped\Ncrying since the moment we met, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, I'm always a crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.40,0:18:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I can't believe my\Nfantasy is finally coming true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The beautiful mermaid princess is in\Ntears because she can't bear to see me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget the new world,\NI'm happy right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, our time with these ladies\Nhas inspired me to compose a new song.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I met my girlfriend at the Mermaid Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I always have a place in my\Nheart for every one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.00,0:18:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to watch you\Ndrown in your own nosebleeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just jealous because they're\Nnot making you to stay, ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you tell them or should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nuntil the tomato box reaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If Big Mom opens the box, it'll explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.60,0:19:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go to the New World now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's gonna murder us\Nthe second we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we start sending\Nher every piece of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,treasure we find for\Nthe rest of our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And she might let it slide just this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If we tell them they sent her a bomb,\Nthey'll lose their will to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.66,0:19:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Minister of the\NRight, those explosives are ten years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.36,0:19:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible they're\Nno longer functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I admire your\Npositivity, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We do keep it rather humid in\Nthe Ryugu Palace, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And who really knows if Big Mom\Nwill open the box herself anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, then let's just hope for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I want to know what you\Ntwo are whispering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.02,0:20:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.72,0:20:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Log Pose for the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.42,0:20:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to take it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.28,0:20:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It frightened me to think that the one\Nyou'd be using had only a single needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So you got a new Log Pose?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it looks pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But why does it have three needles?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.96,0:20:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, take a look at the\Nlong poles on your wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Noticed anything odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still moving. That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we had stayed here\Nlong enough for it to stabilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.72,0:20:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Half a day is all you need,\Nbut that's not the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first half of your journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the long poles was recording the\Nmagnetic waves of each destination,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,so you were able to navigate\Nbetween islands that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the second half of the Grand\NLine won't be so easy to predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.16,0:20:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to the\Ncurrents and the weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:21:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,some of the islands tend to experience\Nchanges in their magnetic waves as well. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.10,0:21:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, some islands have\Nwaves that disappear altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.37,0:21:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how are we supposed\Nto find out where they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're sure to lose\Nyour way with only one needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, fortunately,\Nyou have three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so why is one of the needles moving\Nwhile the other two are sitting still?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this thing works?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.70,0:21:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of the needles is\Nrecording the magnetic
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,waves from one of three\Ndifferent islands. This way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be able to assess\Nmultiple paths and determine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,which way to travel based on\Nyour instincts as a navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.26,0:21:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's likely to make the difference\Nbetween life and death for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.98,0:21:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A skilled navigator will know\Nwhich direction is safest by
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.38,0:21:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,simply observing the slightest\Nmovement of their needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no guarantees, but there is\Na good rule of thumb you can follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.48,0:21:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Erratic movement means more danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.22,0:21:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Changes in magnetic waves are often\Ncaused by abnormalities on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not know that stuff, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with you on this one. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.74,0:22:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go ahead\Nand smash that thing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.94,0:22:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But you mustn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.85,0:22:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing where the danger is will\Nhelp you travel more safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see you night!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.16,0:22:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Little one's going crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be where the\Nparty is, I say we go there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.88,0:22:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but who's the\Nnavigator around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't try to do your job, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me do mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.38,0:22:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well I'm the captain, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.70,0:22:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Captain Luffy, we like being\Nalive, so please listen to her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid, Nami. I'll protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at her, she's so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for the B-Sun, I\Ncall it rightfully a boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.78,0:23:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.61,0:23:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's time to get\Nthis show on the road, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.84,0:23:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Den taught me how to bring\Nthis baby back up to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.12,0:23:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.28,0:23:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.42,0:23:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.33,0:23:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stay here and help\Nthese folks rebuild the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.44,0:23:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you'll be all\Nright without a guide?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, and there's fun having you\Naround, but I think we'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.92,0:23:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, screw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.18,0:23:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need a guide!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.07,0:23:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently we're just\Ngonna waltz our way into
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the world of suffering\Nand death anyway Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.10,0:23:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we all just die right now\Nand save ourselves in trouble, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.36,0:23:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.76,0:23:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.48,0:23:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet your sweet fins I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You ladies are all I dream about!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for the all blue
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.78,0:24:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done so much to help\Nour kingdom. We thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.34,0:24:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray that you will arrive safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.58,0:24:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,By next time, woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.24,0:24:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be way tougher!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.88,0:24:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even tougher than the\NGreat Knight Neptune,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.06,0:24:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll be commanding the most\Npowerful army under the Cephas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, Dorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.12,0:24:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where's...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.66,0:24:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.26,0:25:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. New World, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.22,0:25:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.64,0:25:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sawhat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.28,0:25:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Some more candy and meat sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.78,0:25:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I like humans now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.04,0:25:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and robots and raccoons too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.48,0:25:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm reindeer, but I'll let that one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.94,0:25:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me? Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.88,0:25:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.18,0:25:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back for more takoyaki, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.88,0:25:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.68,0:25:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.94,0:25:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.44,0:25:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.70,0:26:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to say, if\NI get to see you again,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.72,0:26:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,then I promise you, I won't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not as much as now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.96,0:26:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you and I can take\Nanother stroll together, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.82,0:26:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.30,0:26:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.21,0:26:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to go back to\Nyour mom's grave again?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.14,0:26:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.94,0:26:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The place I want to go is farther away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.68,0:26:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to visit a real forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.20,0:26:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,On the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.14,0:26:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.24,0:26:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never been out of\Nthe sea before, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.76,0:26:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.74,0:26:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you there first chance I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.70,0:26:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.64,0:27:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.90,0:27:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll thank you, Sweria.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.00,0:27:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful now, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.44,0:27:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you make a promise, we\Nhave to help you keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.14,0:27:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, no matter what happens,\Nyou must never break a promise, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.72,0:27:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.96,0:27:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.50,0:27:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.06,0:27:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.10,0:27:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.22,0:27:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.68,0:27:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.78,0:27:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.20,0:27:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We've all given our word now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.10,0:27:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No bones about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.34,0:27:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.84,0:27:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't cry anymore? Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.66,0:28:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.46,0:28:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Never forget what they've done for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.00,0:28:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.36,0:28:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.86,0:28:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you pretty please\Nbuy me a Straw Hat, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.26,0:28:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be just like Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.66,0:28:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry buddy, but they don't\Nsell Straw Hats on the sea floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.84,0:29:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go get one from up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.18,0:29:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.52,0:29:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The surface is full of\Nhumans who hate our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.58,0:29:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what they'll do if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.38,0:29:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mean is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.36,0:29:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that some\Nhumans aren't very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.36,0:29:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.38,0:29:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're not all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.94,0:29:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them are heroes,\Nlike Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.82,0:29:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boss Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.14,0:29:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.92,0:29:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just overheard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.30,0:29:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ask a merchant to get his\Nhands on some of those Straw Hats for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.94,0:29:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.98,0:29:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.76,0:29:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd like to be a hero, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.94,0:29:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.26,0:29:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.50,0:29:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All those gorgeous mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.70,0:30:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look alive, you guys! Don't goof off!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.48,0:30:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we ascend, who knows what\Ntrouble we might run into?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.92,0:30:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember how scary it was\Non the way down, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.78,0:30:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.69,0:30:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the weird boxes, Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.78,0:30:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are hollow cubes made out of Banyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.36,0:30:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna help us float.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.00,0:30:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can even adjust the ship's\Nspeed based on how many I throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.30,0:30:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.24,0:30:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we reach the new world...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.94,0:30:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanks won't be far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.42,0:30:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I see him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.78,0:30:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll leave this hat to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.22,0:30:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It means more to me than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.10,0:30:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to bring this hat back to me,\Nbut not until you become a great pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.04,0:30:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one thing that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.08,0:31:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be around to see\Nyou fulfill your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.26,0:31:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.60,0:31:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.78,0:31:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.08,0:31:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.44,0:31:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There is yet joy beyond your sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.34,0:31:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gone may be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.52,0:31:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you still have something left in\Nthis world to treasure, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.90,0:31:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let nothing stop you\Nfrom reaching the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.86,0:31:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you've\Never heard the name
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.54,0:31:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,they use for the second\Nhalf of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.70,0:31:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other side of the red line,\Nat the far reaches of the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.18,0:31:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,is a place that few pirates\Nor marines have ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.58,0:31:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They call it the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.24,0:31:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.98,0:31:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a new era coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and the people who can guide\Nit are gathering on those seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.18,0:31:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They say the one who can master those\Nwaters will become king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.52,0:32:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what's waiting for us up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.62,0:32:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the greatest sea in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.00,0:32:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Took long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.52,0:32:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for some action.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.24,0:32:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now, Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.14,0:32:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one half to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.90,0:32:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,With this new lug pose,\NI can take us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.56,0:32:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And wherever we go,\Nthe Snow can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.18,0:32:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll treat all your injuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as I'm around,\Nyou'll never go hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.80,0:32:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The great Usam's got your back, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.48,0:32:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.70,0:32:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.64,0:32:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,New World! Waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.78,0:32:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
